{"id": "EUVD-2026-98045", "enisaUuid": "4d2babdc-52e9-3863-afd0-693d1919765a", "description": "Frappe ERPNext before 15.119.0 and 16.x before 16.31.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in which certain endpoints fail to verify that the caller may read a document before sending transactional email about it. Authenticated attackers can call these endpoints to trigger transactional email for documents they are not permitted to read.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:22:25", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T13:41:24", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-q8wq-q35q-gj8h", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-erpnext-before-15.119.0-missing-authorization-in-transactional-email-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109654", "GHSA-392r-p4m6-pq6x"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "400f6a9b-218a-377c-aabd-d05df7889e7b", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.31.0"}, {"id": "e155031c-eef0-3ddd-ace9-7a629bad1678", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.119.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "6e5f9d42-85f2-3345-930f-c43ae7bb30f3", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}